---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { ROUTES } from '@/utils/routes';
---

<BaseLayout title="FAQ" description="Frequently asked questions about BirthdayWish.">
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h1 class="text-heading-xl font-extrabold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-body-lg text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
          Everything you need to know about creating birthday experiences.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-3xl space-y-6">
        <details class="card group p-6">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between text-heading-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50">
            Is BirthdayWish free to use?
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
            Yes! BirthdayWish offers a generous free tier that includes up to 3 birthday projects
            with 5 photos each and access to all free themes. Premium features are available for
            those who need more.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="card group p-6">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between text-heading-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50">
            Do I need to create an account?
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
            No account is required to start creating. Your drafts are saved locally in your browser.
            Creating an account lets you access your projects from any device.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="card group p-6">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between text-heading-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50">
            Where are my photos stored?
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
            In the current demo version, photos are stored locally in your browser using
            IndexedDB or localStorage. No photos are uploaded to any server.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="card group p-6">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between text-heading-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50">
            Can I use my own message?
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
            Absolutely! You can choose from our prewritten templates or write your own
            completely custom message. Every message can be personalized with names and details.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="card group p-6">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between text-heading-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50">
            What themes are available?
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
            We offer a variety of themes including elegant, fun, minimal, and animated styles.
            Premium themes with additional visual effects are available with a Premium plan.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-3xl text-center">
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
          Still have questions?{' '}
          <a href={ROUTES.HOME} class="font-medium text-brand-600 hover:underline dark:text-brand-400">
            Reach out to us
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>